# Cloudflare Workers static-assets headers (see runs/redo-v2/05-adr-architecture.md
# §"static SPA assets are served WITHOUT invoking the Worker" / run_worker_first).
# No rule here touches /api/* (Worker responses never read this file).
#
# /* — security headers for every static response, including index.html served
# as the SPA fallback for /, /portfolio, /packages, /my-bookings and /admin.
# Cloudflare merges this rule with the more specific ones below.
#
# The CSP ships as Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only first: deploy, then open
# the site on desktop Chrome, iOS Safari and Android and check the console for
# "[Report Only]" violations (sign-in, registration, password reset, email
# verification). Rename the header to Content-Security-Policy once it is clean,
# and append "; upgrade-insecure-requests" then (browsers ignore that directive,
# with a console warning, in a Report-Only policy).
# Before enforcing:
#   - confirm the authDomain (VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN) matches frame-src; it is
#     assumed to be the default for project sundus-yar-website;
#   - drop the reCAPTCHA sources if reCAPTCHA Enterprise enforcement is off in
#     the Firebase project; add 'unsafe-inline' to style-src only if a
#     Report-Only violation shows the reCAPTCHA badge needs it;
#   - the 'sha256-…' source allows the one inline script in index.html (the
#     home-page hero preload). Editing that script changes its hash: recompute
#     it (sha256 of the exact text between <script> and </script>, base64).
# Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin (audit SEC-12) cuts the link between
# this site and any window that opened it or that it opens, so another page
# cannot navigate a signed-in /admin tab to a look-alike sign-in (reverse
# tabnabbing). Firebase Auth here is email/password only (no signInWithPopup
# or signInWithRedirect), so nothing relies on window.opener.
# HSTS is sent on /api responses by the Worker (worker/http.ts). At the
# custom-domain cut-over add `Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000;
# includeSubDomains; preload` here too, turn on "Always Use HTTPS" for the
# zone and submit the domain to the HSTS preload list.
# After deploying, `curl -sI https://<prod-host>/admin` must show these headers
# on the SPA-fallback response.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-jNVT6TGjVN4dSmYJXmdcf7bMRJ0Iim1BVq+0kU6A4Lo=' https://apis.google.com https://www.google.com/recaptcha/ https://www.gstatic.com/recaptcha/; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com; frame-src https://sundus-yar-website.firebaseapp.com https://www.google.com/recaptcha/ https://recaptcha.google.com/recaptcha/; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

# /assets/* — Vite's hashed JS/CSS build output (the filename itself changes on
# every content change), safe to cache forever.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# /images/* — portfolio/product/brand photos, NOT hashed (an admin/content
# update can replace a file at the same path), so a moderate cache only.
/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

# Private customer/admin views: keep them out of search results even for
# crawlers that do not run JavaScript (04-seo.md §6.3). The SPA fallback
# serves index.html for these paths, so the header applies to that response.
/my-bookings
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/admin
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

# Browse-only preview (audit SEC-08): keep the review copy out of search
# engines. The rule matches by host, the preview Worker's own workers.dev
# address (wrangler.jsonc env.preview "name"), so it is part of every build and
# can never apply to the production host. If the preview is ever served on
# another host, add that host here.
https://sundus-yar-preview.:subdomain.workers.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
